  "pageScreens = document height ÷ viewport height (A: empty and filled; B: each step on entry).",
  "effort = interactionsToSubmit + userScrollScreens (lower = less friction). Error visibility: empty submit (A) / empty step 1 (B), and a realistic miss (only City left empty). \"Visible\" = in the viewport with no extra scrolling."
